# ==============================================================================
# DustIII .gitignore
# ==============================================================================
# Controls file visibility and repository hygiene:
# - Hides transient build artifacts, machine-specific caches, editor states, and secrets.
# - Preserves the static game shell, simulation modules, and shipped art assets.
# ==============================================================================

# ==============================================================================
# SECTION 1: WORKING & PRESERVED FILES (Explicit Whitelists)
# (Guarantees vital project sources, configs, and assets are preserved)
# ==============================================================================

# Core Game Shell & Simulation Sources
!index.html
!js/
!assets/
!assets/ui/icons/
!.gitignore
!.markdownlint.json

# Documentation & Licensing
!readme*.md
!changelog.md
!license
!security.md

# Repository Automation & Community Templates
!.github/

# ==============================================================================
# SECTION 2: HIDDEN & IGNORED ARTIFACTS
# (Local caches, intermediate builds, user states, credentials, diagnostics)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2.1 macOS System & Volume Metadata
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
.ds_store
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2.2 Package Managers, Bundlers & Local Dependencies
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.npm/
.yarn/
.pnpm-store/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2.3 Build Products, Caches & Output Directories
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.tmp/
*.tgz
*.zip

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2.4 Environment Secrets, Private Keys & Tokens
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.token
credentials.json
token.json
*secret*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2.5 Diagnostics, Logs & Telemetry
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2.6 IDEs, Text Editors & AI Agent Working Contexts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.gemini/
.claude/
.cursor/
.windsurf/
.codex/
antigravity.json
.nodeterm/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2.7 Temporary Files, Local Scratchpads & Local Internal Documents
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
tmp/
temp/
scratch/
task.md
todo.md
plan.md
report.md
